00:24:11.520 --> 00:24:13.770
Now, let me walk you through a
typical end-to-end real-time

00:24:13.770 --> 00:24:14.970
analytics flow.

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:17.820
On the left, you have
connectors bringing data in.

00:24:17.820 --> 00:24:19.710
Typically, this data
is then modeled

00:24:19.710 --> 00:24:21.960
in a Medallion
Architecture in Eventhouse

00:24:21.960 --> 00:24:24.990
with multi-tier data staging.

00:24:24.990 --> 00:24:27.390
Data first lands in
the bronze layer,

00:24:27.390 --> 00:24:29.040
which is your raw
ingestion layer.

00:24:29.040 --> 00:24:30.870
Then you use update policies,

00:24:30.870 --> 00:24:33.570
which are like lightweight
transformation functions,

00:24:33.570 --> 00:24:36.840
automatically transforming and
enriching the data as it comes

00:24:36.840 --> 00:24:39.180
and moving it into
a silver layer.

00:24:39.180 --> 00:24:42.090
You can then further optimize
using materialized views

00:24:42.090 --> 00:24:45.690
by deduplicating the data, by
creating aggregation over it,

00:24:45.690 --> 00:24:48.780
so that your reports
can work on top of it.

00:24:48.780 --> 00:24:53.400
For the query part, you can use
KQL for deep analytics or SQL

00:24:53.400 --> 00:24:56.400
for familiarity, depending
on your workflow.

00:24:56.400 --> 00:24:59.940
Now, on the output side, this
data powers real-time dashboards

00:24:59.940 --> 00:25:04.140
and Power BI reports for
monitoring and reporting needs.

00:25:04.140 --> 00:25:07.620
Importantly, everything as
in Fabric is in OneLake.

00:25:07.620 --> 00:25:09.630
All the data is in OneLake.

00:25:09.630 --> 00:25:10.890
It isn't siloed.

00:25:10.890 --> 00:25:14.610
It's fully integrated across
your broader data estate.

00:25:14.610 --> 00:25:16.890
Now, where these
capabilities become really,

00:25:16.890 --> 00:25:21.000
really powerful is by adding
an intelligence layer on top.

00:25:21.000 --> 00:25:23.550
Now, once you have
data streaming in,

00:25:23.550 --> 00:25:27.090
you can define rules, create
alerts with activator,

00:25:27.090 --> 00:25:30.120
even run anomaly detection
