00:25:47.580 --> 00:25:49.860
Now, all these analytical
capabilities are powered

00:25:49.860 --> 00:25:53.940
by Eventhouse, which is a true
multimodal analytics platform.

00:25:53.940 --> 00:25:58.260
At its core, it's designed
for diverse schema-less data.

00:25:58.260 --> 00:26:02.880
You can inject text, JSON,
metrics, time series data.

00:26:02.880 --> 00:26:05.430
That means you don't have to
pre-model or force your data

00:26:05.430 --> 00:26:08.790
into rigid structure before you
start getting value out of it.

00:26:08.790 --> 00:26:11.610
Now, this becomes especially
critical when you're dealing

00:26:11.610 --> 00:26:14.850
with high granularity data
across both time and space,

