such as logs, telemetry,
user actions,

00:26:18.240 --> 00:26:20.820
or even IoT signals coming
from your devices, right,

00:26:20.820 --> 00:26:22.590
where the shape of
the data typically is

00:26:22.590 --> 00:26:24.990
