Anomaly Detector is emitting.

00:40:33.210 --> 00:40:35.370
I can choose which
fields I'm looking for.

00:40:35.370 --> 00:40:39.060
I can maybe even filter down to
a specific set of the events.

00:40:39.060 --> 00:40:40.950
Maybe I don't want
to alert for all

00:40:40.950 --> 00:40:43.710
of the different pieces
that are coming in.

00:40:43.710 --> 00:40:47.910
Just like that, I have a new
alert ready and listening

00:40:47.910 --> 00:40:51.840
for any new anomalies that I can
